    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "Yes, but:\r\n\r\n* IIRC test cases inheriting from `unittest.TestCase` cannot be mixed with `pytest.mark.parameterize`, so we should fix that first\r\n* This will generate a different set of tests across runs if `CUPY_TEST_FULL_COMBINATION=0` is set (i.e. within pull-requests), making it difficult to support pytest-xdist (#5623). This is not a big problem as we don't use xdist now.",
